3. Mandatory attribution

Retain existing copyright, attribution, and license notices in copies of covered
material. For private use, notices may be kept in the source files or
accompanying local documentation; they need not appear in every copy generated
while running the software.
When distributing or publicly sharing covered material, including modified
material and portions incorporated into another application, identify the
original author and project as follows:

Original material by Simeon Vutov
https://github.com/SimeonVutov/dotfiles

When distributing or publicly sharing covered material, provide this attribution
in the repository README, accompanying documentation, an application's credits or
license notices, or a caption accompanying published media. For a hosted
application or public demonstration, credits or documentation linked from the
application or demonstration may be used. The credit must be readable and
accessible to recipients or viewers without additional payment. Identify which
files, components, or media were reused when they are part of a larger work.

Every distribution must include the complete text of this license and the
author's attribution and copyright notice from NOTICE. They may be included in
separate files or reproduced in accompanying documentation. A link to this
repository alone does not replace the requirement to include the license text.
For public sharing that does not provide copies, make the full license text and
notice available in the same credits or documentation, either directly or
through a link to their complete text.

Preserve existing copyright, attribution, and license notices in covered source
files. When distributing or publicly sharing modifications, include a statement
that identifies the modified files or components and summarizes your changes.

Private personal use requires retaining attribution with your local copy; it
does not require a public announcement or an on-screen credit. Attribution must
identify the reused material without implying that Simeon Vutov created your
entire project or endorses it. Do not present covered material as entirely your
own work.

